  "description": "Here's a 5-line summary:\n\n1. The project is a Vue.js AI settings management interface using DaisyUI/Tailwind for styling.\n2. AI Providers and AI Models are configured through modal-based settings forms with fields for API keys, URLs, and billing.\n3. The billing system was updated to support separate `input_k_tokens_cxjcoins` and `output_k_tokens_cxjcoins` fields alongside a legacy `k_tokens_cxjcoins` fallback.\n4. Provider and model cards display billing info with distinct icons: \ud83d\udfe2 green for input cost, \ud83d\udd35 blue for output cost, and \ud83d\udfe1 yellow for the generic fallback.\n5. The fallback cost is only shown in cards when the specific input cost is not defined, ensuring clean and non-redundant UI display.",
